# Genies

Some body text so the first sidebar sits in a real two-column flow beside
ordinary black prose, letting the maroon margin note read as a distinct callout
on the page. This paragraph gives the layout something to set the aside beside.

sidebar(
# Jann Shuyookhs

Jann shuyookhs add the following innate spells: **4th** *invisibility* (×2),
*read omens*.

# Jaathoom Shuyookhs

Jaathoom shuyookhs prefer to manifest wishes informed by their visions of the
future. They add the following innate spells: **5th** *illusory creature*,
*illusory object*, *nightmare* (×2), *sleep* (×2); **4th** *ill omen*.
)

More body text continues after the first sidebar, flowing down the column so the
page has enough ordinary prose to show the maroon callout in context against the
surrounding black body text of the two-column layout.

sidebar(
# Basilisk Lairs

Basilisks can be found in almost any terrestrial environment, including caves,
forests, hills, mountains, plains, and swamps. Their hides often bear
complexions that let them blend with their surroundings.
)

A closing paragraph of body text so the document has enough content to fill the
columns and present both maroon margin callouts in a realistic rulebook context
as the page renders.
